# The production build holds every module in memory at once. The icon set (react-icons/gi,
# about 7 MB of source, imported whole by SafeIcon) already took it close to the heap Node
# picks on a 2 GB machine (about 520 MB), and the sketch sheet's Excalidraw goes past it.
# npm passes this to the scripts it runs (npm run build), not to npm itself.
node-options=--max-old-space-size=1280
